{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000008782","bookName":"La chica buena se cansó","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000008782/42000008782.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":2234779,"followCount":33638,"introduction":"Mi prometido y mi propio hermano me odiaron por diez años, convencidos de que yo acosaba a su inocente flor favorita. En la ceremonia de premiación, señalada por todos, me apuñalaron y me morí. Al abrir los ojos, había renacido diez años atrás. La inocente se echaba agua en la cabeza mientras me preguntaba sonriendo: ¿Ya pensaste cómo vas a disculparte conmigo? ¡Señorita! Enloquecí al instante: ¿Acoso, dices? ¡Yo te enseñaré lo que es el acoso de verdad!","chapterCount":70,"labels":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"typeTwoIds":[335],"typeTwoNames":["Venganza"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":335,"name":"Venganza","replaceName":"venganza"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Venganza","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-chica-buena-se-cansó","bookNameLower":"la-chica-buena-se-cansó","shelfTime":"2026-04-07 17:19:23","firstShelfTime":"2026-04-07 17:19:23","performerList":[{"performerId":"23373","performerName":"Jialu Wu","performerFormatName":"Jialu-Wu","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/3x7/23373/23373.jpg?time=1785750298689","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"19506","performerName":"Zichao Ma","performerFormatName":"Zichao-Ma","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/6x0/19506/19506.jpg?time=1785740607304","videoCount":3}],"performerIdList":[19506,23373]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700591818","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/81/2x8/28x7/287x8/28780000024/700591818_2/700591818.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=p9ccCpIhmWd6r77XTTmo5~7kh~p~2Xqa3i8JrwGge3LpQFpGRmLs2j7Pa8GwnFubwQrWlywXX-PufcuvcUZkg2Tg8byHlTMzyEnQGFxYrW70t1HMdqN0GOEaljHejkBHAH5B70qgvaPQ0D1o6Rs8amwtmNoZuo9MV-wSXWeICJgpTdPNbmF4